name: sim.textEditorGetInfo
description: Retieves information from a text edition window previously opened with sim.textEditorOpen
luaSynopsis: string text, list pos, list size, bool visible = sim.textEditorGetInfo(int handle)
pythonSynopsis: string text, int[2] pos, int[2] size, bool visible = sim.textEditorGetInfo(int handle)
inputs:
1. handle: handle of the text editor window
outputs:
1. text: text of the editor, or None/nil if the given handle is not associated with any text editor window (or the window was already closed)
2. pos: size of the editor
3. size: absolute position the editor
4. visible: visible state the editor
